WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:05.159
Henry was making a pile of leaves.

2
00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:09.021
He laughed as he jumped onto the pile.

3
00:00:09.022 --> 00:00:12.660
For a moment Rabbit forgot his worries.

4
00:00:12.661 --> 00:00:15.971
He was happy to hear Henry laughing.

5
00:00:15.972 --> 00:00:19.045
"Henry will find me soon," Rabbit thought.

6
00:00:19.046 --> 00:00:21.467
"He has to!"

7
00:00:21.468 --> 00:00:25.273
Suddenly Dad came over with a big bag.

8
00:00:25.274 --> 00:00:27.905
Then Mom came with a rake.

9
00:00:27.906 --> 00:00:30.490
"I'm here!" Rabbit cried.

10
00:00:30.491 --> 00:00:36.236
"Under the leaves!"

11
00:00:36.237 --> 00:00:39.094
The rake shot into the pile.

12
00:00:39.095 --> 00:00:45.248
It scooped leaves into the bag.

13
00:00:45.249 --> 00:00:54.480
It scooped Rabbit too!

14
00:00:54.481 --> 00:00:57.854
Mom carried the bag to the curb.

15
00:00:57.855 --> 00:01:04.102
"The garbage truck will pick this up tomorrow," she said.

16
00:01:04.103 --> 00:01:06.343
Rabbit peeked through a hole.

17
00:01:06.344 --> 00:01:14.245
The sun was setting as everyone went inside.

18
00:01:14.246 --> 00:01:17.946
That night Rabbit saw Henry's shadow in the playroom.

19
00:01:17.947 --> 00:01:20.629
Henry was walking back and forth.

20
00:01:20.630 --> 00:01:23.830
"Is he looking for me?" Rabbit thought.

21
00:01:23.831 --> 00:01:29.240
"I'm here, Henry! It's cold!" he called.

22
00:01:29.241 --> 00:01:31.467
Soon the house went dark.

23
00:01:31.468 --> 00:01:33.203
Rabbit shivered.

24
00:01:33.204 --> 00:01:40.754
"Tomorrow the garbage truck will carry me away," he thought.

25
00:01:40.755 --> 00:01:45.628
"I'll never see Henry again."

26
00:01:45.629 --> 00:01:52.589
A tear fell from Rabbit's eye.

27
00:01:52.590 --> 00:01:57.691
It dropped into the grass.

28
00:01:57.692 --> 00:02:01.640
The wet spot began to glow.

29
00:02:01.641 --> 00:02:04.896
Like magic, a flower sprouted!

30
00:02:04.897 --> 00:02:07.923
The white flower glowed in the moonlight.

31
00:02:07.924 --> 00:02:12.248
It began to dance.

32
00:02:12.249 --> 00:02:20.707
"What's happening?" Rabbit thought.

33
00:02:20.708 --> 00:02:23.604
Slowly the flower's petals opened.

34
00:02:23.605 --> 00:02:28.607
Inside was a fairy!

